         <div class="section-head">
           <div><p class="eyebrow">Outreach visibility</p><h2>Pages sent</h2><p>Real landing-page activity across every configured prospect, sorted by the signal that needs attention.</p></div>
           <button class="button outline small" id="refreshCampaignsButton" type="button">Refresh board</button>
