codex
The first endpoint and mocked contract now pass. I caught one reliability issue before broader testing: the initial send path persisted only after Kit replied. I’m tightening that so the row is written before the external call, then updated to `sent` or `failed`; this is the point that guarantees the composed email survives every Kit outcome.
